.dl@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"CEDAU-08","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"SC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"EDII-TN","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"DE la Greenspark","sector":"Enviro-Tech","industry":"Enviro-Tech","ideaDescription":"De La Greenspark integrates Carbon Capture & Utilization (CCU) with alkaline wastewater treatment from leather/textile industries (NaOH/Na₂S-rich effluents), bubbling CO₂ from flue gases into pretreated liquor to form stable carbonates (Na₂CO₃/CaCO₃/MgCO₃ via mineralization with lime sludge), dried via solar dryer into CO2 for construction/chemicals/paper markets. This dual-solution (wastewater neutralization + CO₂ sequestration without extra chemicals) cuts treatment costs (vs acid neutralizati","problemStatement":"De La Greenspark integrates Carbon Capture & Utilization (CCU) with alkaline wastewater treatment from leather/textile industries (NaOH/Na₂S-rich effluents), bubbling CO₂ from flue gases into pretreated liquor to form stable carbonates (Na₂CO₃/CaCO₃/MgCO₃ via mineralization with lime sludge), dried via solar dryer into CO2 for construction/chemicals/paper markets. This dual-solution (wastewater neutralization + CO₂ sequestration without extra chemicals) cuts treatment costs (vs acid neutralization), enables circular economy revenue (₹52/kg CO₂ profit at ₹30/kg Na₂CO₃), targets ₹500Cr TN leather/textile spend.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-08","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"Fashion / Lifestyle, Enviro Tech,","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"