s reinforcement-learning pricing suggestions, on top of ticketing platforms like BookMyShow or Townscript via REST APIs, embeddable wid","problemStatement":"EventBoost is an AI-powered \"smart support system\" plugging into existing event-management platforms rather than replacing them, tackling a gap where organizers (college fests, weddings, expos, corporate events) lack intelligent vendor/sponsor matching and dynamic pricing tools. It layers rule-based and ML-driven vendor, speaker, and sponsor-matching engines, plus reinforcement-learning pricing suggestions, on top of ticketing platforms like BookMyShow or Townscript via REST APIs, embeddable widgets, or white-label SaaS. Revenue combines freemium/Pro subscriptions (₹1,999/month), 3–5% commission on bookings, and white-label deals — targeting India''s 20,000+ college fests and 50,000+ wedding/event planners, projecting 12,000 organizers and ₹5.1 Cr revenue by 2029. Early pilot metrics show 95% of users reporting time savings.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-09","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1PSNb4KAfoToZb3vJ3ZDzvwtjMzaZ7y4H/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","appr