s a rapid, visual molecular diagnostic kit for detecting Helicobacter pylori using a malachite green-based Loop-Mediated Isothermal Amplification (MG-LAMP) assay. Addressing limitations of Rapid Urease Tests and non-portable PCR methods, the kit offers high sensitivity and specificity with a simple color change visible to the naked eye. Operable at a constant 65°C using basic equipment like a water bath, it eliminates complex DNA extraction and reduces fals","problemStatement":"Rapikit Hp by Pocgen Technologies LLP is a rapid, visual molecular diagnostic kit for detecting Helicobacter pylori using a malachite green-based Loop-Mediated Isothermal Amplification (MG-LAMP) assay. Addressing limitations of Rapid Urease Tests and non-portable PCR methods, the kit offers high sensitivity and specificity with a simple color change visible to the naked eye. Operable at a constant 65°C using basic equipment like a water bath, it eliminates complex DNA extraction and reduces false positives. Designed for point-of-care and low-resource settings, Rapikit Hp enables faster, reliable bedside diagnosis, supporting early treatment of gastritis, peptic ulcers, and gastric cancer while improving healthcare accessibility and affordability","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-12","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Med-Tech","domainTags":"SaaS, Bio Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumbe