t design platform that lets users 3DiFy, XRiFy, and GamiFy existing digital assets, supports multiple VR/AR devi","problemStatement":"EnnamOpenupbro Compute Technologies’ XrFactory Designer Studio targets the growing need for accessible, affordable creation of immersive VR/AR and 3D digital content across education, gaming, media, and business, in a market already worth tens of billions of dollars globally yet still dominated by complex, high-cost tools. XrFactory Designer Studio is a fully browser-based, SaaS content design platform that lets users 3DiFy, XRiFy, and GamiFy existing digital assets, supports multiple VR/AR devices (from headsets to low-cost color-filter glasses), and offers AI-enabled, natural-language and gesture-based interactions, aiming to democratize immersive content creation while generating revenue through B2B/B2C subscriptions, training, and design services","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-01","teamSize":2,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"SaaS, EdTech","session":"S2","startupRegistered":"Pvt Ltd"},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"Pvt Ltd","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1AFBWvei8iUFsbPvbpVzaLqXAFsFu4jvS/view?usp=drive_link"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":300000,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,