gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-22","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"General","tier":"Tier 2","college":"EDII-TN","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Medmall","sector":"Med-Tech","industry":"Med-Tech","ideaDescription":"Ventilators in critical care lack continuous IoT monitoring, leaving biomedical teams without breakdown visibility, increasing patient risks from delayed detection, burdening clinicians with manual tracking, and causing missed failure alerts, which heighten mortality in ICUs/NICUs/PICUs. The solution is an end-to-end ecosystem with non-invasive smart sensors tracking vibration, pressure, airflow, and humidity; a central IoT gateway; cloud platform for real-time data intelligence; and AI-driven p","problemStatement":"Ventilators in critical care lack continuous IoT monitoring, leaving biomedical teams without breakdown visibility, increasing patient risks from delayed detection, burdening clinicians with manual tracking, and causing missed failure alerts, which heighten mortality in ICUs/NICUs/PICUs. The solution is an end-to-end ecosystem with non-invasive smart sensors tracking vibration, pressure, airflow, and humidity; a central IoT gateway; cloud platform for real-time data intelligence; and AI-driven predictive maintenance with automated alerts/ticketing, enabling proactive fixes for 99.9% availability via universal retrofit on existing ventilators","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-22","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Med-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, Bio Tech, IoT / Hardware","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":