and schools. Niya Therapy Hub solves this through a VR-based AI-driven platform on Meta Quest headsets, featuring immersive therapy environments, an AI virtual guide for personalized support,","problemStatement":"Autism Spectrum Disorder (ASD) affects 1 in 100 children globally (WHO 2023), impacting over 70 million people worldwide and 10 million in India, with limited therapy access in rural areas due to high costs and scarce trained therapists, burdening individuals with ASD, caregivers, families, therapy centers, and schools. Niya Therapy Hub solves this through a VR-based AI-driven platform on Meta Quest headsets, featuring immersive therapy environments, an AI virtual guide for personalized support, real-time progress tracking, and skill-building modules that blend therapy, education, and engagement—making it portable, scalable, and collaborative unlike costly traditional sessions or non-immersive apps, targeting a $2 billion+ global therapy market.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-rea6ge","teamSize":4,"linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/aathavanvalan1/overlay/about-this-profile/?lipi=urn%3Ali%3Apage%3Ad_flagship3_profile_view_base%3BriTF2OrHS4OJ7A6z6xWIuQ%3D%3D","collegeLinkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/school/st.-joseph%27s-college-of-engineering/","domain":"Ed-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, EdTech, Bio Tech","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrat