erified performance data before hiring, leaving a large employability and trust gap between graduates and employers. ResourceIndia.co proposes an AI-powered, assessment-gated internship marketplace where startups and MSMEs post live projects, students complete supervised, real-world work, and performance is verified using AI and blockchain-based mechanisms, creating a scalable, ready-to-hire talent pool that reduces bad hires and onboarding time","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-25","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Ed-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech, App development / Software","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1svlsWidPE9Mo4IunAUtMRWoX6-3FELRG/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1svlsWidPE9Mo4IunAUtMRWoX6-3FELRG/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-024","applicantName":"Prathib Vamsi P","phone":"9003815145","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-06","type":"team","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"Tier 3","college":"EDII-TN","womenBeneficiaries":13,"ideaName":"MotorX Mobility Private Limited","sector":"Automobile","industry":"Automobile","ideaDescription":"MotorX addresses the environmental and operational challenges of liquid radiator coolants. The problem: liquid coolants generate ~65,000 tons CO₂ annually due to shipping weight (~1.1 kg/L), produce ~12,000 tons plastic waste from PET bottles yearly, and create spill management issues for service centers. The market size is ₹2,350 crores across multiple segments (liquid coolant: ₹950 Cr, powdered: ₹285 Cr, exports: ₹300 Cr+). MotorX''s solution: dry powder radiator coolant in compostable sachets ","problemStatement":"MotorX addresses the environmental and operational challenges of liquid radiator coolants. The problem: liquid coolants generate ~65,000 tons CO₂ annually due to shipping weight (~1.1 kg/L), produce ~12,000 tons plastic waste from PET bottles yearly, and create spill management issues for service centers. The market size is ₹2,350 crores across multiple segments (liquid coolant: ₹950 Cr, powdered: ₹285 Cr, exports: ₹300 Cr+). MotorX''s solution: dry powder radiator coolant in compostable sachets offering 90% transport weight reduction, eliminates plastic, provides 2+ year shelf stability, and enables ₹230 crores revenue potential targeting 11% market share within 3 years.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":1000000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":