llege":"R.M.K. Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":1,"ideaName":"Learnsphere","sector":"SAAS","industry":"SAAS","ideaDescription":"LearnSphere transforms overwhelming note-taking into an adaptive, gamified, AI-powered learning system for students, professionals, and researchers, addressing a gap where 90%+ of Indian learners lack effective self-study tools and existing apps (Notion, OneNote) are cluttered and unpersonalized. It combines a physical pen-and-paper writing experience (via a Digital Sleeve) with offline-first AI processing — multi-format capture, quiz/summary generation, spaced repetition, semantic search, flash","problemStatement":"LearnSphere transforms overwhelming note-taking into an adaptive, gamified, AI-powered learning system for students, professionals, and researchers, addressing a gap where 90%+ of Indian learners lack effective self-study tools and existing apps (Notion, OneNote) are cluttered and unpersonalized. It combines a physical pen-and-paper writing experience (via a Digital Sleeve) with offline-first AI processing — multi-format capture, quiz/summary generation, spaced repetition, semantic search, flashcards, and peer hypothesis-discussion threads. Positioned against Neo Smartpen, XNote AI, Remarkable, GoodNotes, and Supernote, its differentiation is combining real pen feel + comprehensive AI learning + gamification, none of which competitors offer together, at more affordable pricing.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-ywojqq","teamSize":3,"linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/varshaaselva/?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app","collegeLinkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/school/r.m.k-engineering-college/