crowded, cash-based autos that operate without proper compliance or accountability. ROXER CUB proposes a tech-enabled school auto network with fixed verified drivers, live GPS and SOS-enabled parent apps, automated backup driver assignment, and an admin control center, all powered by smart routing and","problemStatement":"ROXER CUB tackles unsafe, unreliable, and untracked school commutes in India, where parents lack GPS visibility, face last-minute transport disruptions when drivers are absent, and contend with overcrowded, cash-based autos that operate without proper compliance or accountability. ROXER CUB proposes a tech-enabled school auto network with fixed verified drivers, live GPS and SOS-enabled parent apps, automated backup driver assignment, and an admin control center, all powered by smart routing and capacity rules, and monetized through distance-based monthly subscriptions and school partnerships to deliver safe, transparent, and scalable daily transport for students","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-26","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"Mobility ,Iot  , SaaS , App Development / Software","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1F6UprY1Bo46MyZFlV5jxGpMy8RoiGBv4/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalD