:[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-031","applicantName":"kalyani patra","phone":"8608499779","email":"aswiga91@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"ipo-28zbru","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Female","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 1","college":"Vellore Institute of Technology, Chennai","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Smart Hundi","sector":"Deep Tech","industry":"Deep Tech","ideaDescription":"Smart Hundi addresses massive inefficiencies and vulnerabilities in the traditional manual management of temple hundi donations, where billions in annual offerings (coins, notes, jewelry) from major temples like Tirupati Balaji face rampant theft during counting, labor-intensive error-prone processing, and difficulties in jewelry valuation, causing substantial financial losses and eroding public trust in temples. Smart Hundi proposes an AI and ML-powered automated system combining real-time imag","problemStatement":"Smart Hundi addresses massive inefficiencies and vulnerabilities in the traditional manual management of temple hundi donations, where billions in annual offerings (coins, notes, jewelry) from major temples like Tirupati Balaji face rampant theft during counting, labor-intensive error-prone processing, and difficulties in jewelry valuation, causing substantial financial losses and eroding public trust in temples. Smart Hundi proposes an AI and ML-powered automated system combining real-time image capturing with hybrid multi-step classification to instantly segregate coins, notes, and jewelry using conveyor-roller mechanisms and high-end imaging, alongside encrypted centralized databases for real-time valuation, digital payment integration, secure storage, and transparent auditing to ensure integrity and accountability in managing sacred offerings","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fun