ege":"startup Walk in","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"CarbonTech Innovations","sector":"Enviro-Tech","industry":"Enviro-Tech","ideaDescription":"India''s 77+ million diabetes patients rely on painful finger-prick tests or expensive, bulky Continuous Glucose Monitors (CGMs) that are inaccessible to rural users, rigid, short-lived, and battery-dependent. The solution is a flexible, skin-conformal wearable patch using microporous carbon electrodes from upcycled PET waste, sesame stalks, and sewage sludge, enabling non-invasive sweat-based glucose sensing via enzyme layers and PVA hydrogel, with smartphone Bluetooth connectivity for real-time","problemStatement":"India''s 77+ million diabetes patients rely on painful finger-prick tests or expensive, bulky Continuous Glucose Monitors (CGMs) that are inaccessible to rural users, rigid, short-lived, and battery-dependent. The solution is a flexible, skin-conformal wearable patch using microporous carbon electrodes from upcycled PET waste, sesame stalks, and sewage sludge, enabling non-invasive sweat-based glucose sensing via enzyme layers and PVA hydrogel, with smartphone Bluetooth connectivity for real-time monitoring at 10x lower cost.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-34","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"Bio Tech , Enviro Tech","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","re