ance on luck over skill/strategy, repetitive mechanics lacking replay value, and few options tailored for students/young adults seeking quick engagement. CheckFlip solves this with a compact, portable board-card hybrid using a unique flip mechanic that blends chess-like strategy, memory, and decision-making into fast-paced 10-minute sessions with easy rules, deep replayability, and social interaction","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-35","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"consumables","domainTags":"EdTech, Sports Tech , Consumables","session":"S6","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iMYV5dCGbdlUDh24yHlB6oced5JQ3Bc2/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iMYV5dCGbdlUDh24yHlB6oced5JQ3Bc2/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-034","applicantName":"Hari Krishnan","phone":"8939797268","email":"Tynkohari@123","memberId":null,"teamId":"CEDAU-36","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"EDII-TN","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Tynko Partner","sector":"SaaS","industry":"SaaS","ideaDescription":"Tynko Partner is a hyperlocal platform tackling the challenge of discovering India''s 10+ crore street vendors and small roadside shops, where uncertain arrival times, unexpected closures, lack of product availability checks, and absence from apps like Zomato force time-wasting street searches and missed purchases. Its walk-and-collect model displays nearby vendors on a map with real-time open/closed status, daily stock, and live locations, letting users reserve items from home before picking up ","problemStatement":"Tynko Partner is a hyperlocal platform tackling the challenge of discovering India''s 10+ crore street vendors and small roadside shops, where uncertain arrival times, unexpected closures, lack of product availability checks, and absence from apps like Zomato force time-wasting street searches and missed purchases. Its walk-and-collect model displays nearby vendors on a map with real-time open/closed status, daily stock, and live locations, letting users reserve items from home before picking up in person—no delivery needed.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-36","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"FinTech, E-Commerce","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{