training platform that places employees in interactive, decision-driven workplace scenarios with real-time res","problemStatement":"SenseUs addresses a major gap in workplace training, where traditional LMS-based programs create awareness but fail to drive lasting behavioral change. Organizations struggle with recurring communication issues, low engagement, and ineffective culture-building because employees rarely get opportunities to practice real workplace situations. SenseUs solves this through a simulation-based training platform that places employees in interactive, decision-driven workplace scenarios with real-time responses, progressive difficulty, and behavior-focused gamification. By enabling continuous practice, reinforcement, and measurable learning outcomes, SenseUs helps embed empathy, respect, and responsible workplace behavior into organizational culture, creating safer, more inclusive, and productive work environments.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-37","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Ed-Tech","domainTags":"EdTech, Enviro Tech","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1mFOPCn7ZHKzvNicJaWvacJD6nFsAMFeD/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1mFOPCn7ZHKzvNicJaWvacJD6nFsAMFeD/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-036","applicantName":"Aparup Roy","phone":"9476478885","email":"aparupdgp713217@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-38","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"General","tier":"Tier 1","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"SensChat","sector":"SaaS","industry":"SaaS","ideaDescription":"SENSChat is a zero-trace anonymous consensus platform addressing three gaps: identity fear on profile-linked social media that suppresses honest sharing of relationship/work/mental health dilemmas, skewed feedback in identity-tracked corporate surveys, and endless argument loops on Reddit/Quora with no conclusive outcome. The solution is an LLM-moderated (Grok API/Llama 4 Scout) sanctuary that purges IP/email data, gates voting behind a 200+ reputation threshold, and ends every thread with a loc","problemStatement":"SENSChat is a zero-trace anonymous consensus platform addressing three gaps: identity fear on profile-linked social media that suppresses honest sharing of relationship/work/mental health dilemmas, skewed feedback in identity-tracked corporate surveys, and endless argument loops on Reddit/Quora with no conclusive outcome. The solution is an LLM-moderated (Grok API/Llama 4 Scout) sanctuary that purges IP/email data, gates voting behind a 200+ reputation threshold, and ends every thread with a locked crowd verdict. Hybrid model: B2C rewards (₹5–15 per streak/vote/comment) drives logic-quality contributors; B2B sells un-sanitized sentiment reports (₹499 standard, ₹999 premium) at 35–40% margin, targeting the $80B market research industry.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-38","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ghr4wKJHaB9cM-p8gmva4wiN-FUH3Mmg/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1ghr4wKJHaB9cM-p8gmva4wiN-FUH3Mmg/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-037","applicantName":"Anantha Kumar","phone":"7845471602","email":"Contacts@ztorys.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-39","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"","tier":"Tier 1","college":"startup Walk in","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Ztorys","sector":"ai","industry":"ai","ideaDescription":"Ztorys is a multi-language digital publishing platform that empowers writers to earn directly from their content without technical barriers or upfront costs. Addressing declining search traffic, high website setup expenses, and unstable monetization, Ztorys enables creators to publish in 340+ languages and earn through 55% ad revenue sharing, sponsored content, promotions, and affiliate commissions. With 110+ active writers, 250+ articles, and growing monthly engagement, the platform combines lo","problemStatement":"Ztorys is a multi-language digital publishing platform that empowers writers to earn directly from their content without technical barriers or upfront costs. Addressing declining search traffic, high website setup expenses, and unstable monetization, Ztorys enables creators to publish in 340+ languages and earn through 55% ad revenue sharing, sponsored content, promotions, and affiliate commissions. With 110+ active writers, 250+ articles, and growing monthly engagement, the platform combines long-form articles and short “Notes” for virality and discovery. Targeting India’s 15 million writers and global creators, Ztorys aims to build a scalable, YouTube-like monetization ecosystem for written content","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate