he solution is an AI-powered neurofeedback platform that combines wearable EEG technology, gamified digital therapy, and real-time brain activity analysis to deliver personalized, non-pharmacological treatment. By adapting therapy based on attention, stress, and fatigue levels, the","problemStatement":"Boja Medtech addresses the growing challenge of cognitive decline, stroke recovery, and mental health management, where traditional therapies often lack personalization, continuous monitoring, and patient engagement. The solution is an AI-powered neurofeedback platform that combines wearable EEG technology, gamified digital therapy, and real-time brain activity analysis to deliver personalized, non-pharmacological treatment. By adapting therapy based on attention, stress, and fatigue levels, the platform improves rehabilitation outcomes, cognitive performance, and therapy adherence. Designed for both clinical and home use, Boja Medtech supports stroke rehabilitation, early dementia care, mental wellness, and CNS research through scalable, data-driven neurotechnology.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-40","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Med-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, Iot , Bio Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1uDPKPYE5yjMZJlz_KH9e1FA4BpniXAqV/view?usp=sharing"},"g