ch":"2026-27","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"startup Walk in","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"xathelete","sector":"SaaS","industry":"SaaS","ideaDescription":"Xthlete is an AI-powered infrastructure layer that converts real tournament participation into verified athlete profiles, ratings, and sponsorship access, connecting athletes, organizers, and brands in one ecosystem. It targets India''s fragmented sports operations—manual registrations, cash/WhatsApp payments, paper-based fixtures, and unstructured tournament data—by digitizing tournament discovery, registration, fixtures, payments, athlete rating/status tracking, and brand sponsorship matching v","problemStatement":"Xthlete is an AI-powered infrastructure layer that converts real tournament participation into verified athlete profiles, ratings, and sponsorship access, connecting athletes, organizers, and brands in one ecosystem. It targets India''s fragmented sports operations—manual registrations, cash/WhatsApp payments, paper-based fixtures, and unstructured tournament data—by digitizing tournament discovery, registration, fixtures, payments, athlete rating/status tracking, and brand sponsorship matching via a web-app. Its edge lies in being the only platform linking all three stakeholder groups, where tournament data automatically builds a verified digital identity attracting sponsors. Grant funds will complete the AI rating logic, sponsorship matching, and cloud infrastructure for pilot testing and trademark filing. Market research and analysis is budgeted as a line item.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-43","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML, Sports Tech