vendor), skilled worker hiring (masons, plumbers, electricians, carpenters), delivery coordination, and project monitoring ","problemStatement":"DECHTA (Fusillade Innotech Ventures LLP, Chennai) is a one-stop digital construction commerce and workforce platform tackling India''s fragmented ecosystem, where 50%+ of the 36–70M construction workforce is informal, materials aren''t reliably available, pricing is opaque, and Tamil Nadu''s 25 lakh+ workers stay disconnected from demand. It unifies material procurement (multi-vendor), skilled worker hiring (masons, plumbers, electricians, carpenters), delivery coordination, and project monitoring on a single app — features scattered across HomeRun, Urban Company, Apna, WorkIndia, IndiaMart. Revenue via commissions on materials, worker bookings, deliveries, interiors, and ads. Currently at MVP stage, seeking ₹7.75L (₹7L from EDII-TN Innovation Voucher), targeting 200+ vendors, 300+ workers, 150+ business customers, and ₹50L+ GTV in 12 months. Claimed impact: 60% faster procurement, 10–20% cost savings.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-46","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"E-commerce , App Development / Software","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1DlTjyBNXXg7rvTQiMFflasG6_1AsoxPH/view?usp=drive_link"},"grant":{"appr