CE’s solution is a technology-enabled career discovery ecosystem that helps users identify career paths aligned with their personality, strengths, values, interests, and readiness within a structured 360-minute process. By combining guided self-discovery, personalized profiling, assessments, and technology-driven insights, CHOiiCE transforms career confusion into clarity and confidence, enabling informed decisions and improved workforce readiness at scale.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-47","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"EdTech, App Development / Software","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/12LN-QBBpvWc6tcuxKPHLibN5bA6aTuD1/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/12LN-QBBpvWc6tcuxKPHLibN5bA6aTuD1/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2026-27"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-045","applicantName":"Pooja sai","phone":"7012679913","email":"poojagokul79@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-48","type":"individual","batch":"2026-27","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Noovara envirotech","sector":"Enviro-Tech","industry":"Enviro-Tech","ideaDescription":"Novaara Ecotechnologies addresses the environmental challenges of conventional paper production, which relies on wood pulp, contributes to deforestation, consumes significant water and energy, and drives India''s dependence on imported waste paper. At the same time, large volumes of fallen leaves and textile cotton waste remain underutilized and are often burned or landfilled. Novaara’s solution is a patented wood-free fiber materials platform that converts upcycled fallen leaves and textile wast","problemStatement":"Novaara Ecotechnologies addresses the environmental challenges of conventional paper production, which relies on wood pulp, contributes to deforestation, consumes significant water and energy, and drives India''s dependence on imported waste paper. At the same time, large volumes of fallen leaves and textile cotton waste remain underutilized and are often burned or landfilled. Novaara’s solution is a patented wood-free fiber materials platform that converts upcycled fallen leaves and textile waste into pelletized feedstock for manufacturing strong kraft paper and sustainable packaging. Compatible with existing paper mill infrastructure, the solution enables recyclable, biodegradable packaging while reducing waste, saving trees, lowering carbon emissions, and strengthening India’s circular economy.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-48","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"FinTech, Fashion / Lifestyle, Enviro Tech","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1a1-cslN2_rNuqqxhNwMaXR9GYvG_YwrY/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1a1-cslN2_rNuqqxhNwMaXR9GYvG_YwrY/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2026-27"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-046","applicantName":"Suhasini B","phone":"7358088146","email":"suhasini090604@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"cedau-49","type":"individual","batch":"2026-27","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Fab again","sector":"Enviro-Tech","industry":"Enviro-Tech","ideaDescription":"Fab Again addresses the growing textile waste challenge in India, where garment factories lose 15–20% of input fabric as cutting waste and most of it ends up in landfills, causing methane emissions and environmental pollution. At the same time, fabric manufacturers face rising costs of virgin yarn with limited access to affordable recycled alternatives. Fab Again’s solution is an asset-light recycled yarn production model that aggregates garment cutting waste and converts it into recycled Open-E","problemStatement":"Fab Again addresses the growing textile waste challenge in India, where garment factories lose 15–20% of input fabric as cutting waste and most of it ends up in landfills, causing methane emissions and environmental pollution. At the same time, fabric manufacturers face rising costs of virgin yarn with limited access to affordable recycled alternatives. Fab Again’s solution is an asset-light recycled yarn production model that aggregates garment cutting waste and converts it into recycled Open-End (OE) yarn through existing shredding and rotor-spinning infrastructure. The company provides cost-effective, traceable, and sustainable yarn that supports circular economy practices while reducing carbon, water, and energy footprints.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"cedau-49","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"Fashion / Lifestyle, Enviro Tech","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"sta