alth-Tech","industry":"Health-Tech","ideaDescription":"Cortivue (\"Cortisol + view — see your stress\") is a wearable spectacles-based stress-sensing device, positioned against biosensor competitors like MUSE, Oura, Bella Beat, and Apple Watch — most of which offer only data visibility or single-metric feedback rather than integrated, actionable stress insight. Cortivue delivers personalized insight and action plans through smart glasses, with 66.1% of 2,217 surveyed consumers open to wearing sensor-equipped spectacles. Revenue model spans hardware sa","problemStatement":"Cortivue (\"Cortisol + view — see your stress\") is a wearable spectacles-based stress-sensing device, positioned against biosensor competitors like MUSE, Oura, Bella Beat, and Apple Watch — most of which offer only data visibility or single-metric feedback rather than integrated, actionable stress insight. Cortivue delivers personalized insight and action plans through smart glasses, with 66.1% of 2,217 surveyed consumers open to wearing sensor-equipped spectacles. Revenue model spans hardware sales, freemium/Pro/Enterprise subscriptions, B2B wellness dashboards, and API/SaaS licensing, targeting frame manufacturers, health-tech apps, insurers, and wellness brands as partners. Market sizing: TAM ~550M glasses-wearers globally, SAM ~44M in urban India, SOM ~66,000 users in 3 years (16.35% CAGR).","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"IPO-mf2rwi","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Health-Tech","domainTags":"SaaS, Bio Tech, IoT / Hardware","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewA