riction/heat/movement, delivering long-lasting freshness surviving 30-40 washes using eco-frie","problemStatement":"Active individuals, professionals, and people in hot/humid/active environments experience discomfort and self-consciousness from body odor and fading clothing freshness throughout the day, as current apparel lacks lasting fragrance or odor control. Curio solves this through microencapsulation technology embedding fragrance microcapsules into fabric fibers during textile finishing for smart release via friction/heat/movement, delivering long-lasting freshness surviving 30-40 washes using eco-friendly non-toxic materials, offered as stylish affordable D2C apparel targeting Gen Z/millennials/active lifestyle adopters within India''s $8.89B functional apparel market and $160.2M→$857.9M smart textiles niche (20.5% CAGR).","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-2us6k","teamSize":3,"linkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/akshay--sk?utm_source=share&utm_campaign=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=ios_app","collegeLinkedin":"https://www.linkedin.com/school/psg-college-of-technology/","domain":"Fashion","domainTags":"Fashion / Lifestyle, Enviro Tech","session":"S6","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iWc68HJJJgFSsLxllZe3TY45JOCKec0Z/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":