1","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Vision Solve","sector":"Ed-Tech","industry":"Ed-Tech","ideaDescription":"Vision Solve AI addresses high-cost quality education, language barriers for regional-medium students, limited rural access to advanced resources, lack of late-night academic support, online learning distractions from YouTube/Google, and disorganized study materials causing missed exam opportunities. Students face financial exclusion despite government schemes, struggle with English-medium comprehension despite basic skills, lack consistent rural educational access, study late nights without per","problemStatement":"Vision Solve AI addresses high-cost quality education, language barriers for regional-medium students, limited rural access to advanced resources, lack of late-night academic support, online learning distractions from YouTube/Google, and disorganized study materials causing missed exam opportunities. Students face financial exclusion despite government schemes, struggle with English-medium comprehension despite basic skills, lack consistent rural educational access, study late nights without personalized help reducing sleep quality, waste time on distracting online content, and lose marks from poor resource organization. The solution offers 24/7 AI tutoring with multilingual support, personalized learning plans using uploaded notes, integrated digital library, AI quiz generation, custom video explanations, interactive simulations for complex concepts, and question paper evaluation with performance analysis—accessible nationwide via smartphone/internet.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-9e48xs","teamSize":31,"linkedin":"htt