vidual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Female","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 1","college":"Alagappa College of Technology","womenBeneficiaries":1,"ideaName":"indyarn Clean Tech","sector":"Agri Tech","industry":"Agri Tech","ideaDescription":"India''s leather industry generates substantial non-recyclable waste polluting landfills while urban gardening/landscaping faces high water usage, weed growth, and poor soil health in terrace gardens, lawns, and green spaces across Chennai/Tamil Nadu with TAM of 80 million sq.ft greenable surfaces. Indyarn Clean Tech solves this through eco-friendly agrotextiles made from leather waste that prevent weed growth, offer breathable/biodegradable/durable moisture retention, thermoregulation, soil heal","problemStatement":"India''s leather industry generates substantial non-recyclable waste polluting landfills while urban gardening/landscaping faces high water usage, weed growth, and poor soil health in terrace gardens, lawns, and green spaces across Chennai/Tamil Nadu with TAM of 80 million sq.ft greenable surfaces. Indyarn Clean Tech solves this through eco-friendly agrotextiles made from leather waste that prevent weed growth, offer breathable/biodegradable/durable moisture retention, thermoregulation, soil health enrichment, and 30-50% water conservation while improving yields 25-35%, paired with add-on services including compost supply, saplings, soil testing, maintenance contracts, and 3-5 year warranties under tiered packages (Basic ₹60/sqft to Platinum ₹250/sqft) targeting corporates, retail, government, and premium customers.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SS-e7fr19","teamSize":1,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Agri-Tech","domainTags":"Sa