pplicantName":"naveen kumar","phone":"8939724423","email":"naviinkumar209@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"sc-3yn3y","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"General","tier":"Tier 1","college":"St. Joseph''s College of Engineering , OMR, Chennai.","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Pentastech","sector":"Deep-Tech","industry":"Deep-Tech","ideaDescription":"AgriAi by Pentastech  solves Indian farmers'' crop losses from poor soil management and fertilizer overuse—India applies 166.9 kg/ha (4x global average) yet sees suboptimal yields due to nutrient imbalances, manual testing delays, and lack of actionable insights. Small farmers, advisors, and the environment suffer from imprecise applications causing soil degradation and runoff. The autonomous rover with smart probe uses IoT sensors (NPK, pH, moisture), Raspberry Pi, GPS/GIS for real-time nutrient","problemStatement":"AgriAi by Pentastech  solves Indian farmers'' crop losses from poor soil management and fertilizer overuse—India applies 166.9 kg/ha (4x global average) yet sees suboptimal yields due to nutrient imbalances, manual testing delays, and lack of actionable insights. Small farmers, advisors, and the environment suffer from imprecise applications causing soil degradation and runoff. The autonomous rover with smart probe uses IoT sensors (NPK, pH, moisture), Raspberry Pi, GPS/GIS for real-time nutrient mapping, and AI via React Native app for crop/fertilizer recommendations, outperforming costly static probes like Teralytic with full mobility, affordability, and B2B/B2C scalability","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"sc-3yn3y","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Deep-Tech","domainTags