ffice professionals, and fitness enthusiasts, it solves the inconvenience of accessing safe, temperature-controlled water while reducing reliance on disposable plastic bottles. Featuring space-grade insulation (up to 12-hour retention), Peltier-based temperature control, and AWS-powered ","problemStatement":"COLDHOT is a smart, portable water bottle designed to provide instant heating or cooling within 5–10 minutes, combined with built-in UV-C purification and IoT-enabled app control. Targeting travelers, students, office professionals, and fitness enthusiasts, it solves the inconvenience of accessing safe, temperature-controlled water while reducing reliance on disposable plastic bottles. Featuring space-grade insulation (up to 12-hour retention), Peltier-based temperature control, and AWS-powered mobile connectivity, COLDHOT blends convenience, hygiene, and sustainability. Currently in prototype stage, the product plans urban market entry via e-commerce with 20–30% profit margins, scalable manufacturing, and expansion into institutional, corporate, and global markets.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-ecrjpqw","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Consumables","domainTags":"IoT / Hardware, Consumables , Health Tech","session":"S6","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/17d-7F8ya_H6PxxxxcwOvvTarwPgPOlaN/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":300000,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/17d-7F8ya_H6PxxxxcwOvvTarwPgPOlaN/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"grant","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-094","applicantName":"gopikakanagaraj","phone":"8610004262","email":"gopikakanagaraj1111@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-nx45i","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Female","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"Ragas Dental College and Hospital","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Haptic Verse","sector":"MedTech","industry":"MedTech","ideaDescription":"In dental education where over 318 colleges and 27,000 students in India mostly train on phantom head models that lack real tactile feedback, leading to low confidence, higher faculty supervision needs, and potential patient discomfort during the transition to clinical practice. This problem is widespread and contributes to significant stress and difficulty for a large proportion of dental students. The solution is Haptic Verse, a 3D haptic-based dental simulator for OHI-S that combines realisti","problemStatement":"In dental education where over 318 colleges and 27,000 students in India mostly train on phantom head models that lack real tactile feedback, leading to low confidence, higher faculty supervision needs, and potential patient discomfort during the transition to clinical practice. This problem is widespread and contributes to significant stress and difficulty for a large proportion of dental students. The solution is Haptic Verse, a 3D haptic-based dental simulator for OHI-S that combines realistic tactile feedback, AI-based scoring, dual teacher–student modes, and analytics to deliver affordable, scalable, and objective skill training aligned to Indian dental curricula.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-nx45i","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Med-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech, Bio Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/100spzmnKXgcVCDW56dtZMhsgCfTyMSe0/edit?slide=id.p8#slide=id.p8"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":300000,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/100spzmnKXgcVCDW56