me":"Lensora AI","sector":"blank","industry":"blank","ideaDescription":"SterilySense is a dual-mode robot combining vacuum cleaning with UV-C disinfection and TiO₂ photocatalysis, tackling healthcare-associated infections that affect 1 in 25 patients daily and cause ~90,000 preventable U.S. deaths yearly, especially in low-resource clinics reliant on manual cleaning. It disinfects both horizontal and vertical surfaces via a 360° rotating arm, using AI anomaly detection (UV-A scan, microscopic confirmation, UV-C kill) instead of timer-based cleaning, with a live dash","problemStatement":"SterilySense is a dual-mode robot combining vacuum cleaning with UV-C disinfection and TiO₂ photocatalysis, tackling healthcare-associated infections that affect 1 in 25 patients daily and cause ~90,000 preventable U.S. deaths yearly, especially in low-resource clinics reliant on manual cleaning. It disinfects both horizontal and vertical surfaces via a 360° rotating arm, using AI anomaly detection (UV-A scan, microscopic confirmation, UV-C kill) instead of timer-based cleaning, with a live dashboard tracking hotspots and bacteria levels. Lab tests showed bacterial colonies dropping to zero post-treatment. Claims up to 70–90% HAI reduction and ~40% lower cleaning costs versus chemical methods.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-6y3eg","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"blank","domainTags":"SaaS, Bio Tech, Robotics / Automation","session":"","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankNam