"SC","tier":"Tier 1","college":"College of Engineering Guindy, Anna University","womenBeneficiaries":1,"ideaName":"Blue Core Innovations","sector":"IOT","industry":"IOT","ideaDescription":"ManholeBot 360 from Blue Core Innovations addresses deadly manual scavenging in India, where workers still enter toxic, silted manholes and open sewers that existing suction and desilting machines cannot clean effectively, leading to ongoing fatalities, disease exposure, and slow, infrastructure-damaging maintenance that requires many machines. ManholeBot 360 proposes a fully remote, hydraulically actuated telescopic dredging system with a spherical-wrist cutter that operates up to 8–15 meters d","problemStatement":"ManholeBot 360 from Blue Core Innovations addresses deadly manual scavenging in India, where workers still enter toxic, silted manholes and open sewers that existing suction and desilting machines cannot clean effectively, leading to ongoing fatalities, disease exposure, and slow, infrastructure-damaging maintenance that requires many machines. ManholeBot 360 proposes a fully remote, hydraulically actuated telescopic dredging system with a spherical-wrist cutter that operates up to 8–15 meters deep, converts thick sludge into pumpable slurry using filtered sewer water, works with existing super sucker trucks, and achieves 120–150 Lpm excavation—around 15 times faster than current solutions—aiming to eliminate human entry, raise sanitation standards, and enable scalable deployment through a tested, IP-protected proof-of-concep","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":400000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-xu2qlg","teamSize":24,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Deep-Tech","domainTags":"Robotics / Automation","session":"S3","s