ription":"The document addresses the limitations of current lithium‑ion battery energy storage, including high cost, safety risks, performance degradation, limited energy density, slow charging, and poor performance in extreme climates. It frames this as a broad challenge for reliable, affordable, climate‑resilient energy storage. As a solution, it develops an eco‑friendly process to convert eucalyptus bark waste into nitrogen‑, sulfur‑, and phosphorus‑doped porous activated carbon, optimized for use as h","problemStatement":"The document addresses the limitations of current lithium‑ion battery energy storage, including high cost, safety risks, performance degradation, limited energy density, slow charging, and poor performance in extreme climates. It frames this as a broad challenge for reliable, affordable, climate‑resilient energy storage. As a solution, it develops an eco‑friendly process to convert eucalyptus bark waste into nitrogen‑, sulfur‑, and phosphorus‑doped porous activated carbon, optimized for use as high‑performance supercapacitor electrode material that offers fast charging, long cycle life, and cost‑effective energy storage.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-30","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Renewable Energy","domainTags":"Deep Tech","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X28ckk2B2gna7Ohu1co1xCtOLuMRGGAP/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1X28ckk2B2gna7Ohu1co1xCtOLuMRGGAP/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"grant","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-108","applicantName":"W Karunakaran","phone":"9840620303","email":"wkarunakaran12b@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"CEDAU-31","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"General","tier":"Tier 1","college":"Agni College of Technology","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Pro EduVate","sector":"Ed-Tech","industry":"Ed-Tech","ideaDescription":"This document describes an AI-integrated learning system that tackles the lack of affordable, interactive tools for visually and hearing-impaired learners who struggle with limited regional Braille and sign-language resources, high costs, and poor support for self-learning. It highlights a large, underserved population facing low literacy and inaccessible technology, then proposes a solution combining tactile Braille hardware, AI-driven personalized lessons, speech-to-text, text-to-speech, OCR, ","problemStatement":"This document describes an AI-integrated learning system that tackles the lack of affordable, interactive tools for visually and hearing-impaired learners who struggle with limited regional Braille and sign-language resources, high costs, and poor support for self-learning. It highlights a large, underserved population facing low literacy and inaccessible technology, then proposes a solution combining tactile Braille hardware, AI-driven personalized lessons, speech-to-text, text-to-speech, OCR, and sign-language animations to make education more accessible, engaging, and scalable through low-cost hybrid hardware–software design and regional language support","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-31","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Ed-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech, IoT / Hardware, App Development / Software","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1uaQshK-D_57QpLN85tltdCO-_hdPOfkC/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1uaQshK-D_57QpLN85tltdCO-_hdPOfkC/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"grant","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-109","applicantName":"Saigovind V / Sadhana","phone":"9789095971","email":"mandolinsaigovind@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-bgbq2f","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"SyncField","sector":"SaaS","industry":"SaaS","ideaDescription":"SyncField addresses the problem of fragmented IT and service delivery caused by small firms using multiple disconnected ERP and project management tools, leading to data silos, delayed updates, invisible risks, and compliance gaps that erode client trust and project success. SyncField proposes an AI-powered intelligence meta-layer that unifies existing ERP and PM tools without replacing them, introducing Aegis—an escalation prediction and prevention engine—alongside Trust Ledger for accountabili","problemStatement":"SyncField addresses the problem of fragmented IT and service delivery caused by small firms using multiple disconnected ERP and project management tools, leading to data silos, delayed updates, invisible risks, and compliance gaps that erode client trust and project success. SyncField proposes an AI-powered intelligence meta-layer that unifies existing ERP and PM tools without replacing them, introducing Aegis—an escalation prediction and prevention engine—alongside Trust Ledger for accountability, Client Visualiser for transparency, Smart Nudge Engine for proactive alerts, and SyncField Green for ESG regulatory compliance, enabling IT SMBs to orchestrate delivery, control risks, and meet sustainability goals in real time.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-bgbq2f","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ENBbWjMrus_c-pGMptggJFsm1nLYauzS/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ENBbWjMrus_c-pGMptggJFsm1nLYauzS/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-110","applicantName":"Naveen P","phone":"9566834018","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"sc-cr3j8","type":"individual","batch":"2026-27","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Sugarless Wonders","sector":"Food tech","industry":"Food tech","ideaDescription":"Sugarless Wonders is a line of truly sugar‑free, diabetic‑safe traditional sweets that use natural low‑GI sweeteners and innovative natural binders to preserve authentic mithai taste and texture while avoiding sugar spikes and artificial chemicals. It targets overconsumption of refined sugar and the resulting rise in diabetes, obesity, and heart disease by offering functional, protein- and gut‑friendly desserts that are safe for daily use and celebrations. The IVP grant is planned for R&D, formu","problemStatement":"Sugarless Wonders is a line of truly sugar‑free, diabetic‑safe traditional sweets that use natural low‑GI sweeteners and innovative natural binders to preserve authentic mithai taste and texture while avoiding sugar spikes and artificial chemicals. It targets overconsumption of refined sugar and the resulting rise in diabetes, obesity, and heart disease by offering functional, protein- and gut‑friendly desserts that are safe for daily use and celebrations. The IVP grant is planned for R&D, formulation optimisation, pilot production, nutritional validation, certifications, and market entry with commercially ready products.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":false,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"sc-cr3j8","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Food tech","domainTags":"Bio Tech, Food Tech, Consumables","session":"S4","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","