f which keep yields low and incomes unstable. The solution combines AI-driven soil and crop analysis, weather-based advisory, real-time market intelligence, a multi-language + SMS chatbot, a transparent vendor marketplace with APMC-approved suppliers, and on-demand shared services (drones, machinery, skilled labour) in one simple, affordable platform that’s scalable for individual farmers, cooperatives, NGOs and government programs, with strong social and environmental impact.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-dbkdjs","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Agri-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, AgriTech, E-Commerce, IoT / Hardware, App Development / Software","session":"S4","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AKxv-vEykgim5SRlL5e67fYOaca71-EL"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/open?id=1AKxv-vEykgim5SRlL5e67fYOaca71-EL","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-112","applicantName":"Shanmuga Pradeepan R","phone":"8438532004","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-dg0km","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"Sethu Institute of Technology","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Edufyte","sector":"ai","industry":"ai","ideaDescription":"The problem is that many students and fresh graduates, particularly from Tier 2 and Tier 3 colleges, struggle to secure employment due to lack of industry-relevant skills, unclear career paths, and limited real-world exposure, while companies simultaneously face difficulty finding suitable talent, creating recruitment inefficiencies. In India, about 15 million students graduate annually, with over 80% deemed unemployable in high-growth sectors, meaning nearly 12 million learners each year requir","problemStatement":"The problem is that many students and fresh graduates, particularly from Tier 2 and Tier 3 colleges, struggle to secure employment due to lack of industry-relevant skills, unclear career paths, and limited real-world exposure, while companies simultaneously face difficulty finding suitable talent, creating recruitment inefficiencies. In India, about 15 million students graduate annually, with over 80% deemed unemployable in high-growth sectors, meaning nearly 12 million learners each year require support. The solution integrates AI-powered resume enhancement, JD-based mock interviews, recruiter-side screening, and personalized learning paths into a single unified platform for job readiness.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-dg0km","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/17wdKIj5f9f7Im3Onqxb8JBSWlOHmnusB/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/17wdKIj5f9f7Im3Onqxb8JBSWlOHmnusB/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-113","applicantName":"S Jeevesh","phone":"9025314278","email":"jeeveshs18@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-dyjltj","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"Panimalar Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Navogenix Technologies","sector":"ai","industry":"ai","ideaDescription":"Manual labor dominates over 75% of Indian warehouses, slowing fulfillment, increasing safety risks, and elevating costs, while grid-based automation requires fixed layouts, high upfront investment (₹60–90L/zone), and complex infrastructure changes, making it inaccessible for small and mid-sized warehouses. The Indian warehouse automation market addresses 3PL, cold storage, FMCG, and e-commerce sectors with diverse, dynamic layouts. Navogenix Porter is an AI-powered, non-grid autonomous robot usi","problemStatement":"Manual labor dominates over 75% of Indian warehouses, slowing fulfillment, increasing safety risks, and elevating costs, while grid-based automation requires fixed layouts, high upfront investment (₹60–90L/zone), and complex infrastructure changes, making it inaccessible for small and mid-sized warehouses. The Indian warehouse automation market addresses 3PL, cold storage, FMCG, and e-commerce sectors with diverse, dynamic layouts. Navogenix Porter is an AI-powered, non-grid autonomous robot using sensor fusion (LiDAR, stereo vision, UWB, IMU) that carries payloads (50–200kg) across any warehouse floor without infrastructure changes, deployable in 1–2 days at ₹3.5–5L/unit—60–70% lower cost than traditional grid systems—with real-time obstacle avoidance, cloud-based monitoring, and modular scalability designed specifically for Indian warehousing realities.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-dyjltj","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, FinTech, E-Commerce, IoT / Hardware , Robotics / Automation","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","gra