ndia (35M+ pet dogs) with animal suffering, emotional distress, and safety risks. The app offers AI-driven smart mat","problemStatement":"Canine Connect, India’s first verified pet matchmaking platform, addresses key gaps in the dog and pet ecosystem: no unified platform for adoption/health/lost & found services, lack of health verification enabling unethical breeding, sick puppies overwhelming shelters, inefficient fragmented lost pet recovery, and missed vaccination tracking, impacting 14-15M urban paw parents in India (35M+ pet dogs) with animal suffering, emotional distress, and safety risks. The app offers AI-driven smart matchmaking (breed/age/health/location), verified profiles/certifications, secure in-app chat/video calls, QR-based lost & found, health insights/vaccination schedules, and vet/NGO connections via freemium + subscription model targeting ₹700M SOM in Tamil Nadu.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-e2mmc2","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, E-Commerce","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qjD-GcXz1UuBFOMudOdluGNs9fC7t9JA/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"rel