olving solo players'' struggles finding compatible partners when friends are busy, newcomers seek buddies, or introverts hesitate to socialize. It promotes daily sports for irregular players to improve skills/fitness while fostering social connections for students/professionals; Competi","problemStatement":"APEX  is a first-of-its-kind offline sports pairing mobile app using skill-based ratings (like Chess.com) for real-time proximity matching across badminton, football, table tennis, tennis, pickleball, and shuttle—solving solo players'' struggles finding compatible partners when friends are busy, newcomers seek buddies, or introverts hesitate to socialize. It promotes daily sports for irregular players to improve skills/fitness while fostering social connections for students/professionals; Competitive edges include rating-driven fairness, geolocation speed, and multi-sport support vs generic find-a-friend apps.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-3gcyak","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"EdTech, App Development / Software, Sports Tech","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1uK1jvNK5uZzUPeWETKPYgSroJ5mXheZM/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","b