gs, wire coatings, and PCB shells pollute landfills, contaminate land/water, and expose waste workers/communities to toxic materials especially in urban/semi-urban areas like Chennai, Delhi NCR, and Mumbai. RMK Aerospace''s sustainable e-waste bricks solve this through a low-energy process shredding/mixing/pressing/curing non-recyclable e-waste with eco-binder","problemStatement":"India generates over 3 million tons of e-waste annually, with only 20% formally recycled while non-recyclable components like plastic casings, wire coatings, and PCB shells pollute landfills, contaminate land/water, and expose waste workers/communities to toxic materials especially in urban/semi-urban areas like Chennai, Delhi NCR, and Mumbai. RMK Aerospace''s sustainable e-waste bricks solve this through a low-energy process shredding/mixing/pressing/curing non-recyclable e-waste with eco-binders into durable, thermally insulating, soundproof construction bricks/tiles featuring ≤90% less water consumption, no kiln firing/zero emissions, 30–50% cheaper cost, compressive strength up to 8–10 MPa, faster curing (3–7 days), modular decentralized manufacturing, and circular economy impact within India''s ₹6.5 lakh crore brick market.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-fmdki","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"Enviro Tech,  , Deep Tech","session":"S5","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumb