ising pattern of gunfire-related violence and security incidents in India, where static or manual surveillance struggles to quickly detect and localize gunshots in dynamic, high‑risk environments, putting armed forces, police, responders, and civilians at serious risk. This problem spans conflict-prone and border regions nationwide, with recent attacks causing multiple deaths, injuries, evacuations, and repeated military interventions. The solution is Tactical Bee, a drone-based, AI‑powered gunshot detection network using FPGA processing, microphone arrays, thermal imaging, and swarm control to deliver real-time mobile detection, rapid threat localization, and flexible coverage, backed by a phased plan for prototyping, FPGA integration, field testing, and market entry","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"Sc-g8mwsh","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Deep-Tech","domainTags":"SaaS,  IoT / Hardware","session":"S3","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16ki4JOqN7ZPYPneTQ1mW-roDP89_Q7B8/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/16ki4JOqN7ZPYPneTQ1mW-roDP89_Q7B8/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-122","applicantName":"abishek A","phone":"8610961896","email":"abishek372006@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"sc-h83z6f","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"SC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"Kongu Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Hydros","sector":"Agri-Tech","industry":"Agri-Tech","ideaDescription":"Hydros addresses the global need for sustainable, local food in water-scarce, urban and peri-urban regions, where families and small farmers lack space, depend on chemical-intensive soil farming, and face rising demand for healthy produce without affordable, efficient technology. Hydros proposes a solar-powered, IoT-driven aquaponics system that combines fish and plants in a closed-loop unit using sensors, automated pumps, and aeration to maintain water and nutrient balance, reducing water use b","problemStatement":"Hydros addresses the global need for sustainable, local food in water-scarce, urban and peri-urban regions, where families and small farmers lack space, depend on chemical-intensive soil farming, and face rising demand for healthy produce without affordable, efficient technology. Hydros proposes a solar-powered, IoT-driven aquaponics system that combines fish and plants in a closed-loop unit using sensors, automated pumps, and aeration to maintain water and nutrient balance, reducing water use by up to 90%, eliminating chemical inputs, and enabling compact, scalable, low-maintenance farming for households, small farmers, and institutions","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"sc-h83z6f","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Agri-Tech","domainTags":"AgriTech, CleanTech , IoT / Hardware, food Tech","session":"S4","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15VC3YOTSvBp5zx_f2_UnedEDj7sMRjGc/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15VC3YOTSvBp5zx_f2_UnedEDj7sMRjGc/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-123","applicantName":"Shirish","phone":"8939747045","email":"-","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-hetzhm","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"College of Engineering, Guindy","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"PickMyseat.ai","sector":"ai","industry":"ai","ideaDescription":"TNEA counselling is complex with high stakes; students lack process familiarity and struggle with trend prediction for choice list creation, often making errors due to insufficient expert guidance. 1.5 lakh TNEA aspirants annually face counselling complexity; manual methods and limited coaching center sessions are insufficient. Mistakes can have irreversible consequences on educational outcomes. PickMySeat.AI is a web-based, freemium SaaS platform offering real-time TNEA mock counselling simulat","problemStatement":"TNEA counselling is complex with high stakes; students lack process familiarity and struggle with trend prediction for choice list creation, often making errors due to insufficient expert guidance. 1.5 lakh TNEA aspirants annually face counselling complexity; manual methods and limited coaching center sessions are insufficient. Mistakes can have irreversible consequences on educational outcomes. PickMySeat.AI is a web-based, freemium SaaS platform offering real-time TNEA mock counselling simulation, AI-based cutoff prediction using trend analysis, and personalized AI-powered choice recommendations. It targets both B2C users (students/parents) and B2B (colleges) with scalability to other counselling systems like KEA, JoSAA, and NEET.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-hetzhm","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, EdTech","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDat