ized feedback (speech-to-text/NLP scoring), dual GD modes (AI bots + live peers), public ","problemStatement":"Tier 2 & 3 students in India lack access to affordable quality interview coaching, struggling with communication skills, confidence, grammar, tone, and group discussions (GD) for HR/managerial rounds, while traditional training remains expensive and geographically limited. Speak Karo by Genoid Infotech solves this via a mobile-first AI platform simulating dynamic HR/Manager interviews with real-time personalized feedback (speech-to-text/NLP scoring), dual GD modes (AI bots + live peers), public speaking practice, and progress scorecards, targeting underserved students to boost employability/inclusivity","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":false,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-i8ijt","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Ed-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech, App Development / Software","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1AGp92K4_64IgcM-2B-4hcOB_R8Gr-GZe/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"