actors/suppliers via uploaded material lists with competitive quotes, AI-driven project scheduling/milestone tracking/escrow payments, AR/VR previews, targeting India''s ₹5,070B home services TAM (₹42B online SAM) fueled by urbanization and 60%+ digital-first urban consumers through 15-20% commissions, premium listings, subscriptions, and ads.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-ireg2m","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, FinTech,  , Deep Tech","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cBdWM-yx1Et9L-TzJYMXq4fBO_v_P6uC/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1cBdWM-yx1Et9L-TzJYMXq4fBO_v_P6uC/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-126","applicantName":"Harini Premkumar","phone":"6381337230","email":"harinipofficialcb@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-j51bjj","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"R.M.K. Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Spar Shield+","sector":"Med-Tech","industry":"Med-Tech","ideaDescription":"India''s overcrowded public hospitals see 15% of patients contracting hospital-acquired infections (HAIs)—with up to 10% fatal—across 860,000+ government beds serving 770M people (55% population) and 260M+ BPL citizens via Ayushman Bharat, driven by inconsistent manual cleaning/hygiene in general wards. SparShield+ solves this via a modular hybrid light barrier using safe 405nm indigo-blue LEDs (not harmful UV-C) positioned between beds for continuous chemical-free air/surface disinfection in occ","problemStatement":"India''s overcrowded public hospitals see 15% of patients contracting hospital-acquired infections (HAIs)—with up to 10% fatal—across 860,000+ government beds serving 770M people (55% population) and 260M+ BPL citizens via Ayushman Bharat, driven by inconsistent manual cleaning/hygiene in general wards. SparShield+ solves this via a modular hybrid light barrier using safe 405nm indigo-blue LEDs (not harmful UV-C) positioned between beds for continuous chemical-free air/surface disinfection in occupied spaces, killing ESKAPE pathogens/SARS-CoV-2 via ROS production disrupting bacterial quorum sensing, featuring low-cost plug-and-play scalability, IoT-ready monitoring, eco-friendly operation, targeting tier 1-3 hospitals/government tenders in India''s $1.88B infection control mark","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp"