stry":"IoT","ideaDescription":"Flovepal Greenspace develops IoT-enabled smart plant pots designed to help urban residents easily grow and maintain indoor plants despite limited time, space, and knowledge. Targeting working professionals aged 25–45 in metro cities, the smart pot uses soil moisture sensors, automated irrigation, and a companion mobile app (Flutter + Firebase) to monitor plant health, send alerts, and provide personalized care tips. With eco-friendly 3D-printed casing and optional subscription-based app features","problemStatement":"Flovepal Greenspace develops IoT-enabled smart plant pots designed to help urban residents easily grow and maintain indoor plants despite limited time, space, and knowledge. Targeting working professionals aged 25–45 in metro cities, the smart pot uses soil moisture sensors, automated irrigation, and a companion mobile app (Flutter + Firebase) to monitor plant health, send alerts, and provide personalized care tips. With eco-friendly 3D-printed casing and optional subscription-based app features, Flovepal follows a razor-and-blades revenue model (₹2000 per unit + ₹99/month). The solution promotes healthier indoor air, reduced stress, and sustainable urban living through effortless smart gardening","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-lvrbhd","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"IoT","domainTags":"AgriTech, IoT / Hardware, App Development / Software, Deep Tech","session":"S3","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifsc