e lights run at full brightness without need, failures go undetected, and lack of automation leads to energy waste, higher emissions, and safety risks. The scale of the problem involves city-wide networks that lose crores of rupees annually and create dark zones when lamps fail. The solution, Fluxora SmartLight, is an IoT-enabled system using sensor fusion, LoRa communication, and AI-based analytics to adapt brightness to movement and weather, detect faults in real time, cut electricity use by 60–70%, extend lamp life, and enable centralized monitoring for large deployments.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"sc-mnnn9n","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Industry 4.0","domainTags":"IoT / Hardware , App Development / Software","session":"S3","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ah--a7bYtRmDx9Kk1r_kXVKF3d9aC0Po/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1Ah--a7bYtRmDx9Kk1r_kXVKF3d9aC0Po/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-130","applicantName":"Satyendra / Lakshmi Priya","phone":"8092225251","email":"satyendra0778@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"IPO-ozm1k","type":"team","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"Tier 1","college":"IIT Madras","womenBeneficiaries":3,"ideaName":"Scout Edge","sector":"ai","industry":"ai","ideaDescription":"ScoutEdge is an AI-powered cricket talent scouting and performance analytics platform focused on uncovering hidden players from Tier 2, Tier 3, and rural India who currently lack access and verified performance data. It tackles subjective, slow, and biased traditional scouting by providing an AI rating system that combines match performance, video analytics, fitness and challenge metrics, along with player dashboards, scout dashboards, and academy/tournament integration, already tested with 500+","problemStatement":"ScoutEdge is an AI-powered cricket talent scouting and performance analytics platform focused on uncovering hidden players from Tier 2, Tier 3, and rural India who currently lack access and verified performance data. It tackles subjective, slow, and biased traditional scouting by providing an AI rating system that combines match performance, video analytics, fitness and challenge metrics, along with player dashboards, scout dashboards, and academy/tournament integration, already tested with 500+ players, multiple scouts and academies, and supported by state associations like Bihar and Bengal. The platform uses an AI/ML, cloud-based, mobile-first SaaS stack with subscription and data-insights revenue, and seeks IVP funding of about ₹8.06 lakh (total project cost ~₹9.10 lakh) to scale design, fabrication, validation, and commercialization of this end-to-end ecosystem from player to franchise.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"IPO-ozm1k","teamSize":212,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, App Development / Software, Sports Tech","session":"S1","startupRegistered":"Pvt Ltd"},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"Pvt Ltd","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18TKSjzu0XBMIfcvR-TzwQO4eOlv5TP4I/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":300000,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/18TKSjzu0XBMIfcvR-TzwQO4eOlv5TP4I/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"grant","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-131","applicantName":"Bharat Ms / Madhu Pragadeshwaran","phone":"9080265174","email":"pragadeesmpw@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-nryy8h","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"Madras Institute of Technology, Chromepet","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"GAGS","sector":"Consumables","industry":"Consumables","ideaDescription":"The Aerial LED-Drone Advertising project offers short-duration octocopter flights carrying transparent, thin LED mesh displays that show scrolling promotional messages over crowded local areas like markets and events. It addresses the high cost, poor targeting, and audience fatigue of traditional advertising (billboards, TV ads), which typically show low ROI and are often ignored. The system uses Pixhawk/QGC-controlled drones with customizable mesh sizes for daylight-visible, flexible, DGCA-comp","problemStatement":"The Aerial LED-Drone Advertising project offers short-duration octocopter flights carrying transparent, thin LED mesh displays that show scrolling promotional messages over crowded local areas like markets and events. It addresses the high cost, poor targeting, and audience fatigue of traditional advertising (billboards, TV ads), which typically show low ROI and are often ignored. The system uses Pixhawk/QGC-controlled drones with customizable mesh sizes for daylight-visible, flexible, DGCA-compliant campaigns, priced affordably to serve small and medium businesses rather than only large brands. It also positions the drone platform for logistics and aerial survey use cases beyond advertising. Grant funds will support prototype fabrication, DGCA certification, and pilot campaigns; a business survey confirmed strong demand across retail, fitness, and event sectors.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-nryy8h","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Consumables","domainTags":"Deep Tech , Drones","session":"S6","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zvoBHLHzNkEc_Tko9TpmvngKFuliUMRn/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1zvoBHLHzNkEc_Tko9TpmvngKFuliUMRn/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-132","applicantName":"Thanvi M","phone":"9380184164","email":"thanvi1313@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-ewhypl","type":"team","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"Tier 2","college":"R.M.K. Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":4,"ideaName":"SafeStride Tech","sector":"AI/ML","industry":"AI/ML","ideaDescription":"Poorly marked potholes and speed breakers cause accidents, vehicle damage, and delays due to slow manual inspections, inconsistent reporting, and lack of real-time alerts, especially in urban/rain-prone areas amid rising smart city/autonomous vehicle needs. SafeSTride Tech by Thanvi M solves this via a hybrid AI-IoT Raspberry Pi system combining ultrasonic sensors + YOLOv8 computer vision for accurate onboard pothole/speed breaker detection/classification with instant LED/buzzer/OLED alerts, off","problemStatement":"Poorly marked potholes and speed breakers cause accidents, vehicle damage, and delays due to slow manual inspections, inconsistent reporting, and lack of real-time alerts, especially in urban/rain-prone areas amid rising smart city/autonomous vehicle needs. SafeSTride Tech by Thanvi M solves this via a hybrid AI-IoT Raspberry Pi system combining ultrasonic sensors + YOLOv8 computer vision for accurate onboard pothole/speed breaker detection/classification with instant LED/buzzer/OLED alerts, offering affordable/scalable ADAS integration, IoT/smart city compatibility","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":15000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-ewhypl","teamSize":4,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, IoT / Hardware, EV / Mobility, Robotics / Automation","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1qUQVHPhnQ3qdrzuMrbhNc2rdmt8eokYp/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":15000,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","