 harmful screen use and digital fatigue, where over 63% of parents and 72% of teens report negative impacts like addiction, weak family bonds, and reduced emotional connection, especially in urban and semi-urban families heavily reliant on devices. This affects millions of parents, children, teens, educators, and mental health professionals globally. The solution is KinSync, an AI-powered mobile platform that combines shared planning, screen-time visualization, memory sharing, and age-based bonding and wellness activities into a single family app, aiming to reduce screen time and strengthen relationships through personalized, togetherness-focused experiences.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-paxd4f","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"SaaS","domainTags":"AI / ML , App Development / Software","session":"S2","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xq7J9KAZck44UQZR2L1-9K3gje5SnQ5O/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1xq7J9KAZck44UQZR2L1-9K3gje5SnQ5O/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-137","applicantName":"Naveen Kanna","phone":"6374990762","email":"16naveenkannaa@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-pcw53a","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 3","college":"Panimalar Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Asynchonix","sector":"Deep-Tech","industry":"Deep-Tech","ideaDescription":"Around 1.3 billion people (16% of the world) live with significant disabilities, many with severe mobility impairments for whom existing wheelchairs and assistive devices remain non-lifting, inefficient, and unable to provide versatile, high-performance, independence‑enhancing movement or performance augmentation. This technology gap leaves disabled users dependent on others and offers no unified solution that combines rehabilitation, mobility, and human performance enhancement. The proposed sol","problemStatement":"Around 1.3 billion people (16% of the world) live with significant disabilities, many with severe mobility impairments for whom existing wheelchairs and assistive devices remain non-lifting, inefficient, and unable to provide versatile, high-performance, independence‑enhancing movement or performance augmentation. This technology gap leaves disabled users dependent on others and offers no unified solution that combines rehabilitation, mobility, and human performance enhancement. The proposed solution is an AI-powered exoskeleton that is 20–30% lighter, up to 40% cheaper via AI design and string‑tension actuation, adaptable, comfortable, irritation‑free, and temperature‑regulated for intuitive everyday use.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-pcw53a","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Deep-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, Bio Tech , Deep Tech , Robotics / Automation","session":"S3","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1j0u6rTzUBFBf7-jCFUsqyiQ-ftfNRYpJ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1j0u6rTzUBFBf7-jCFUsqyiQ-ftfNRYpJ/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-138","applicantName":"Mohamed Shameer M","phone":"6380652935","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC