 a technically driven method with defined competitive and technical advantages, aimed at extending usability and reducing wast","problemStatement":"The problem addressed is the need for effective tomato preservation without reliance on refrigeration. The scale of the problem is significant, as it targets post-harvest losses and preservation challenges in contexts where cold storage is limited or unavailable. The developed solution focuses on a smart, non-refrigerated tomato preservation approach. The project proposes a technically driven method with defined competitive and technical advantages, aimed at extending usability and reducing wastage. The solution is designed to deliver social and environmental benefits while remaining cost-effective, supported through a grant model covering a major portion of the project cost","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-qdmhpb","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Med-Tech","domainTags":"AgriTech, Enviro Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1wggAGBMSMlgdD-zX_qRXkmL0vKLyx013/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":""