r ₹20–40 lakh proprietary CASA hardware and reducing human error and variability in male fertility diagnostics. It offers WHO‑compliant, lab‑branded digital reports on a pay‑per‑use SaaS model, is hardware‑independent and multilingual, and is positioned as India’s first digital andrology service focused on democratising reliable male","problemStatement":"Crea AI is an AI‑powered, cloud‑based semen analysis platform that automates sperm count and motility from standard microscope images/videos, eliminating the need for ₹20–40 lakh proprietary CASA hardware and reducing human error and variability in male fertility diagnostics. It offers WHO‑compliant, lab‑branded digital reports on a pay‑per‑use SaaS model, is hardware‑independent and multilingual, and is positioned as India’s first digital andrology service focused on democratising reliable male infertility testing for Tier‑2/3 labs, with a ₹4.9 lakh MVP budget to build, validate, and ready the platform for commercialization.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":300000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"CEDAU-13","teamSize":21,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Health-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML , SaaS, Bio Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":"Pvt Ltd"},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"Pvt Ltd","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1EY4tKzCIaQBfbR5vLwYbW2vf_P4rABJO/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","s