00194696","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"IPO-ojc1rs","type":"team","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"","tier":"Tier 1","college":"Startup Walk in","womenBeneficiaries":5,"ideaName":"Geosonic","sector":"Industry 4.0","industry":"Industry 4.0","ideaDescription":"Geosonic explores unsafe interactions between overhead and floor cranes in heavy equipment factories, where existing light-based anti-collision sensors are unreliable due to dust, lighting variations, maintenance difficulty, and blind spots, creating significant risk of collisions and accidents across dynamic crane operations. The solution is a scalable, low-cost ultrasonic sensor–based anti-collision system using custom microcontroller PCBs, a PLC-controlled sensing setup, MODBUS communication,","problemStatement":"Geosonic explores unsafe interactions between overhead and floor cranes in heavy equipment factories, where existing light-based anti-collision sensors are unreliable due to dust, lighting variations, maintenance difficulty, and blind spots, creating significant risk of collisions and accidents across dynamic crane operations. The solution is a scalable, low-cost ultrasonic sensor–based anti-collision system using custom microcontroller PCBs, a PLC-controlled sensing setup, MODBUS communication, and a handheld interface to ensure accurate distance detection, coordinated crane interlocking, and easier deployment across multiple crane systems","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":700000,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"IPO-ojc1rs","teamSize":21517,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Industry 4.0","domainTags":"IoT / Hardware","session":"S3","startupRegistered":"Pvt Ltd"},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","d