 and subscribers nationwide, helping owners scale affordably and givi","problemStatement":"The problem is that most registered chit funds operate locally with a limited subscriber base, while users struggle to find trusted schemes in their location and ticket size, pushing them toward unregistered chits that cause scams and erode public trust. This creates systemic risk for both investors and small chit businesses across India. The solution is a “Zerodha for chit funds” mobile aggregator app that connects chit owners and subscribers nationwide, helping owners scale affordably and giving users wide, verified investment options, thereby reducing illegal chits and supporting formal, taxed finance.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-ug8ozm","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"FinTech","domainTags":"FinTech","session":"S8","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1awm9MVqtyTkxmRySzpoln5Jidbh6KYqQ/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1awm9MVqtyTkxmRySzpoln5Jidbh6KYqQ/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-148","applicantName":"Tejashree","phone":"8106872520","email":"","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-v4m8f","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"","caste":"","tier":"","college":"Sathyabama Institute of Science and Technology","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Little Hands","sector":"Deep-Tech","industry":"Deep-Tech","ideaDescription":"Little Hands addresses the problem that children with autism and their families struggle to access timely, affordable, and personalized therapy, as most current treatments are clinic-based, expensive, and hard to tailor, especially in remote or underserved areas. This issue is widespread, leading to developmental delays and significant emotional and financial stress for many families who face long wait times and limited options. The solution is LITTLE HANDS, a hybrid therapy toolkit that combine","problemStatement":"Little Hands addresses the problem that children with autism and their families struggle to access timely, affordable, and personalized therapy, as most current treatments are clinic-based, expensive, and hard to tailor, especially in remote or underserved areas. This issue is widespread, leading to developmental delays and significant emotional and financial stress for many families who face long wait times and limited options. The solution is LITTLE HANDS, a hybrid therapy toolkit that combines physical sensory and motor tools with VR, AI‑driven personalization, home-based delivery, and continuous digital support to provide accessible, individualized therapy directly at home.","proposedSolution