","caste":"","tier":"","college":"Easwari Engineering College","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"SSGhealthcare pvt ltd","sector":"Health-Tech","industry":"Health-Tech","ideaDescription":"Cell Guard One addresses late-stage cancer detection, limited rural access to diagnostics, invasive and radiation-based screening methods, and overburdened hospitals that lack efficient pre-screening tools, leaving large populations under-screened and diagnosed only when treatment is complex and outcomes are poor. Cell Guard One proposes a low-cost, portable, non-invasive, zero-radiation device that uses low-power ultrasound and biosignal sensing with smartphone-based AI to generate instant mult","problemStatement":"Cell Guard One addresses late-stage cancer detection, limited rural access to diagnostics, invasive and radiation-based screening methods, and overburdened hospitals that lack efficient pre-screening tools, leaving large populations under-screened and diagnosed only when treatment is complex and outcomes are poor. Cell Guard One proposes a low-cost, portable, non-invasive, zero-radiation device that uses low-power ultrasound and biosignal sensing with smartphone-based AI to generate instant multi-cancer risk scores, enabling mass pre-screening, early referral to advanced tests only for high-risk cases, and cloud-enabled follow-up in both urban and remote settings","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"sc-v80p8o","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Health-Tech","domainTags":"Bio Tech, AI","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate"