ere verified students connect with veri","problemStatement":"The problem is the lack of a safe, direct way for students to talk to professionals they aspire to become, as existing platforms limit messaging without premium access, have low response rates, and expose students to scams, fake mentors, and shallow web-only knowledge. With over 25 million college students in India and rising demand for localized, personalized mentorship, this gap is large. The solution is ORIONIX, an AI-powered mentorship social network where verified students connect with verified mentors through secure calls/chats and 3D AI-driven VR/AR avatars, offering multilingual, experience-based guidance.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-vnqnnm","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"ai","domainTags":"AI / ML, EdTech","session":"S1","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ydjWJIArLgff7w189FF0XTyw-wB4x8qz/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/1ydjWJIArLgff7w189FF0XTyw-wB4x8qz/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-152","applicantName":"Santhoshkumar  P","phone":"9843930292","email":"santhoshpalanisamy292@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-Votrgd","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 2","college":"P.A. College of Engineering and Technology","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"FITNGRO","sector":"Health-Tech","industry":"Health-Tech","ideaDescription":"Generic fitness apps provide uniform plans without personalization, lack real-time monitoring of workout execution, cannot correct form leading to injuries during home workouts, with 79% of elderly inactive and 50% of women quitting due to lack guidance/accountability, while rural/remote users have limited gym and affordable expert access. FitnGro solves this with an AI-powered platform delivering personalized adaptive workout plans based on user fitness level and progress, real-time computer vi","problemStatement":"Generic fitness apps provide uniform plans without personalization, lack real-time monitoring of workout execution, cannot correct form leading to injuries during home workouts, with 79% of elderly inactive and 50% of women quitting due to lack guidance/accountability, while rural/remote users have limited gym and affordable expert access. FitnGro solves this with an AI-powered platform delivering personalized adaptive workout plans based on user fitness level and progress, real-time computer vision form correction ensuring correct posture and injury prevention, certified expert fitness and diet guidance, gamified engagement through streaks/rewards/challenges, holistic all-in-one integration of workouts/diet/progress tracking, privacy-first on-device AI processing, and offline PWA accessibility for rural/low-connectivity areas.​","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-Votrgd","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Health-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, Sports Tech","session":"S7","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/175HtfDzRpsYzA33iIXRw_akLqNQCY8sF/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/175HtfDzRpsYzA33iIXRw_akLqNQCY8sF/edit?usp=sharing&ouid=104277249549708518105&rtpof=true&sd=true","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-153","applicantName":"Vignesh S","phone":"7358254947","email":"vnsarans@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-wv04l9","type":"individual","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 2","college":"St. Joseph''s College of Engineering , OMR, Chennai.","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"APIDS","sector":"deep-Tech","industry":"deep-Tech","ideaDescription":"APIDS develops autonomous drone fleets equipped with smart sensors and chemical spray systems to detect and instantly suppress toxic gas leaks in industrial zones like refineries, chemical plants, and oil & gas facilities, addressing unpredictable dangers where 91% of sites face recurring risks, 56% of safety teams seek automation, and 100% of current systems fail at effective suppression. Key differentiators include fleet-based coordination for large-area coverage without human intervention, ac","problemStatement":"APIDS develops autonomous drone fleets equipped with smart sensors and chemical spray systems to detect and instantly suppress toxic gas leaks in industrial zones like refineries, chemical plants, and oil & gas facilities, addressing unpredictable dangers where 91% of sites face recurring risks, 56% of safety teams seek automation, and 100% of current systems fail at effective suppression. Key differentiators include fleet-based coordination for large-area coverage without human intervention, active neutralization (not just detection), and AI-powered hotspot prediction for preemptive action—offered via Drone-as-a-Service (DaaS) subscriptions (₹10K basic detection to ₹2L+ enterprise fleets with analytics), targeting safety managers via expos, partnerships, and digital campaigns, with a 50% complete prototype (Raspberry Pi 4 AI integration, projecting ARR growth to ₹4Cr by 2038 amid 25% conversion and 65% churn metrics","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"rejected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-wv04l9","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"deep-Tech","domainTags":"AI / ML, SaaS, Drones , Deep-Tech , Robotics / Automation","session":"S3","startupRegistered":""},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumber":"","bankName":"","ifscCode":"","branch":""},"registration":{"udyamNumber":"","gstNumber":"","panNumber":"","registrationType":"","pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iNwwr51csQl5L2HxqfHq3mcSrEpifNmI/view?usp=sharing"},"grant":{"approvalDate":"","sanctionLetterNo":"","approvedAmount":0,"grantType":"Grant Fund","bankVerification":"Pending","agreementStatus":"Pending","phase1":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase2":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""},"phase3":{"amount":0,"eligibleAmount":0,"releaseDate":"","status":"pending","refNumber":"","remarks":""}},"pitchLink":"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1iNwwr51csQl5L2HxqfHq3mcSrEpifNmI/view?usp=sharing","documents":[],"notes":[],"createdDate":"2026-09-17","lastUpdated":"2026-09-17","history":[{"date":"2026-09-17","time":"12:00","user":"System","action":"Imported from CED Excel","from":"","to":"registration","remarks":"Batch 2025-26"}]},{"applicationId":"GRT-2026-27-154","applicantName":"Roshan","phone":"8754864334","email":"22ad30@kcgcollege.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"SC-y4ea0v","type":"team","batch":"2025-26","gender":"Male","caste":"General","tier":"Tier 3","college":"KCG College of Technology","womenBeneficiaries":1,"ideaName":"Hyrowah","sector":"Enviro-Tech","industry":"Enviro-Tech","ideaDescription":"WaterWise by hyrowah Technologies tackles severe inland water pollution in India, where contaminated surface waters seep into groundwater causing health crises like cancer, compounded by inefficient manual cleaning and delayed traditional monitoring that fails to catch anomalies in real-time. Local lakes accumulate plastics, debris, oil, and sewage, with municipal responses too slow and reports arriving too late to prevent spread. The solution deploys autonomous surface bots for multi-point real","problemStatement":"WaterWise by hyrowah Technologies tackles severe inland water pollution in India, where contaminated surface waters seep into groundwater causing health crises like cancer, compounded by inefficient manual cleaning and delayed traditional monitoring that fails to catch anomalies in real-time. Local lakes accumulate plastics, debris, oil, and sewage, with municipal responses too slow and reports arriving too late to prevent spread. The solution deploys autonomous surface bots for multi-point real-time monitoring (24+ parameters from 6 inputs via DNN), debris/oil collection, 3D lakebed modeling, and adaptive treatments using nanobubble tech plus eco-friendly biotech like Moringa and Guar Gum.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"grant","status":"selected","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":true,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"SC-y4ea0v","teamSize":24,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedin":"","domain":"Enviro-Tech","domainTags":"Enviro Tech, IoT / Hardware, Robotics / Automation","session":"S5","startupRegistered":"LLP"},"rounds":{},"finalEval":{"status":"pending","decision":"","remarks":"","date":""},"edi":{"status":"not_submitted","grantReviewAppId":"","decisionDate":"","remarks":""},"bank":{"accountName":"","accountNumb