e":"Ummul Fayiza","phone":"9994608057","email":"xihg06ummulfayiza@gmail.com","memberId":null,"teamId":"TNS-288","type":"individual","batch":"2026-27","gender":"Female","caste":"OBC","tier":"Tier 1","college":"SRM IST KTR","womenBeneficiaries":0,"ideaName":"Orbiscan","sector":"Med-Tech","industry":"Med-Tech","ideaDescription":"ORBISCAN is India''s first indigenous wireless intraoral dental scanner with real-time fluid filtration, tackling three barriers: messy alginate molds causing patient discomfort and distortion, imported digital scanners costing ₹15–25 lakhs (unaffordable for 90% of Indian clinics), and even those scanners failing in \"wet\" mouths with saliva or blood. ORBISCAN''s proprietary \"Wet-Scan\" AI filters fluid artifacts in real-time, using a software-defined imaging engine on low-cost wireless sensors to h","problemStatement":"ORBISCAN is India''s first indigenous wireless intraoral dental scanner with real-time fluid filtration, tackling three barriers: messy alginate molds causing patient discomfort and distortion, imported digital scanners costing ₹15–25 lakhs (unaffordable for 90% of Indian clinics), and even those scanners failing in \"wet\" mouths with saliva or blood. ORBISCAN''s proprietary \"Wet-Scan\" AI filters fluid artifacts in real-time, using a software-defined imaging engine on low-cost wireless sensors to hit sub-millimeter (5-micron) precision at ₹1.5–2 lakhs — a 90% cost cut versus imports, with no recurring subscription fees. It generates a full-arch 3D scan in under 60 seconds and transmits STL/OBJ files to labs instantly, cutting turnaround from 7 days to 24 hours.","proposedSolution":"","businessModel":"","expectedImpact":"","fundingRequested":0,"stage":"registration","status":"pending","bootcamp":{"attended":true,"date":"","remarks":""},"data":{"consentLetter":false,"fundingTemplate":false,"msmeRegistered":false,"msmeNumber":"","status":"pending","submittedDate":"","teamId":"TNS-288","teamSize":0,"linkedin":"","collegeLinkedi